4	//! specification for pixi.
5	//!
6	//! The `PixiSpec` type represents the user input for a package. It can
7	//! represent both source and binary packages. The `PixiSpec` type can
8	//! optionally be converted to a `NamelessMatchSpec` which is used to match
9	//! binary packages.
